  "prompt": "Điểm kiểm tra (thang điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>100</mn></semantics></math>) cuối khóa môn Tiếng Anh của hai lớp ở một trung tâm ngoại ngữ được thống kê ở bảng sau:\n\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Thời gian</td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>70</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số học viên lớp A</td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>0</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>50</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://w